---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import chivilcoyImage from '../assets/images/chivilcoy.jpg';
---
<section class="py-20 bg-brand-cream border-t border-brand-teal/10">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12">
      <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
        <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl group animate-scale-in">
          <!-- Chivilcoy landscape -->
          <div class="aspect-[4/3] bg-brand-blue relative">
            <Image src={chivilcoyImage} alt="Software Chivilcoy, Buenos Aires" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105 mix-blend-overlay opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100" />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-blue via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full p-8 flex flex-col justify-end">
              <div class="text-left text-brand-cream translate-y-4 group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-transform duration-500">
                <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-brand-green mb-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"></path><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path></svg>
                <h4 class="text-3xl font-black text-brand-cream drop-shadow-lg">Chivilcoy</h4>
                <p class="text-brand-teal font-semibold text-lg drop-shadow-md">Buenos Aires, Argentina</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-brand-blue mb-6">Empresa de Software Local, <br/><span class="text-brand-teal">Alcance Global</span></h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-brand-blue/70 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          Como líderes en el desarrollo de software en Chivilcoy, combinamos la tranquilidad y el valor de la palabra del interior argentino con el empuje tecnológico de la innovación constante. 
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg text-brand-blue/70 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          Esta identidad nos permite ofrecer soluciones digitales altamente competitivas, garantizando profesionalismo de primer nivel mundial sin perder la cercanía y el compromiso que nos caracteriza.
        </p>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="border-l-4 border-brand-teal pl-4">
            <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-blue">100%</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-brand-blue/60 mt-1">Compromiso y Transparencia</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
